### What was fixed

Removed the `author:` plain-string field from 19 recipe/sub/ YAML files. Goose schema expects `author: {name: '...', email: '...'}` as a struct or absent — a plain string like `author: MAS Engineering` causes `goose run --explain` to fail with `Error: author: invalid type: string '...', expected struct Author`.

76/96 recipes have no `author` field and work fine, so this is the correct fix.

